2
00:00:03,040 --> 00:00:03,840
confusa.

3
00:00:03,840 --> 00:00:07,120
Mirá este ejemplo: mucho zoom, pero no sabemos qué

4
00:00:07,120 --> 00:00:07,840
importa.

5
00:00:07,840 --> 00:00:10,880
